# Build context for api/Dockerfile and ai/Dockerfile (both build from this folder).
# Keeps host builds, secrets, uploads and downloaded models out of the images; the images install
# their own Linux node_modules and Python packages.
.git
.env
.env.*
uploads
backups
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
api/src/generated
api/coverage
ai/.venv
ai/.models
ai/.tryon-eval
ai/.autoresearch
ai/tests
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
# macOS metadata (AppleDouble files on non-APFS volumes)
**/._*
**/.DS_Store
